      "writtenOn": "2021-04-13T12:45:18Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Extracted into separate method. Not on the ctx as I am not sure that this is going to be more generally needed but just in the same file for now.\n\nYou can call Failed() to see if an error has been reported but you can\u0027t tell who reported it. It also doesn\u0027t work when allow missing dependencies is true. The AddFarVariationDependencies() method does return an array of module references, each one corresponding to the name in the input list of names. If it did not find the module the reference is nil. So I have added a check to ensure that was not found.\n\nWe do have pretty good test coverage of this code, both for the normal and error cases so we should be ok.",
      "parentUuid": "589e9d4d_5840690f",
      "revId": "2120ee6261c5afa1fd763796c527bab5ff785334",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
